{"id":"9541fa6d255ae78d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-set-cover.md","title":"SET-COVER","display":"df-set-cover — SET-COVER","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-set-cover","aliases":["28-df-set-cover","SET-COVER"],"display":"df-set-cover — SET-COVER","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-set-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-set-cover</span><span>SET-COVER</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-cover — SET-COVER"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SC}}:\\{(U,\\mathcal S,k):U\\subseteq\\mathbb N,\\ |U|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(U),\\ k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SC}}:\\{(U,\\mathcal S,k):U\\subseteq\\mathbb N,\\ |U|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(U),\\ k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是固定的单射编码。其源表示为按自然数递增列出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>、按成员序列字典序列出的各集合及二进制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>；所有整数使用无前导零二进制表示，各列表显式记录长度。编码、逆解码与合法性检查均在源表和字串的位长内为多项式时间，编码长度与源表位长彼此多项式有界。该编码作为固定结构参数，不随实例改变。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SETCOVER}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(U,\\mathcal S,k)\\ \\middle|\\\nU\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land |U|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(U)\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\;(|\\mathcal C|\\le k\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal C=U)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SETCOVER}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(U,\\mathcal S,k)\\ \\middle|\\\nU\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land |U|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(U)\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\;(|\\mathcal C|\\le k\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal C=U)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是显式集合覆盖判定版。原书例5.6中的 SUCCINCT SET COVER 用布尔公式隐式表示指数规模全集上的集合，属于不同表示与不同复杂性层次；不可把二者直接等同。空全集允许零集合覆盖。</p>\n<p>来源核对：参照例5.6；印刷99页；PDF125页。本定义为显式表示的本地补充，原书该处陈述的是简洁表示版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(U)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SC}}:\\{(U,\\mathcal S,k):U\\subseteq\\mathbb N,\\ |U|<\\aleph_0,\\ \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(U),\\ k\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SETCOVER}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(U,\\mathcal S,k)\\ \\middle|\\\nU\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land |U|<\\aleph_0\\land\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(U)\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\;(|\\mathcal C|\\le k\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal C=U)\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1661,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"图问题：[[28-df-finite-graph]]、[[28-df-clique]]、[[28-df-vertex-cover]]、[[28-df-independent-set]]、[[28-df-hamiltonian-cycle]]、[[28-df-graph-coloring]]、[[28-df-set-cover]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}